        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832570/extras/1f6cf2ddbe78fa1d42377981c77bbda4.poster.avif?t=1756072989\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832570/extras/1f6cf2ddbe78fa1d42377981c77bbda4.webm?t=1756072989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832570/extras/1f6cf2ddbe78fa1d42377981c77bbda4.mp4?t=1756072989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to<strong> BOSS UP</strong> in this white-knuckle <strong>Bullet Hell Boss Rush</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Roger, a dodge-rolling horse with a dream! His life goal is to win the VZN tournament and gain his very own Boss Form, becoming a big time Videogame Boss! His journey won't be easy, so get ready for a brutal, keyboard-smashing challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These aren't just your run of the mill run and gun bosses, no no! These bosses come from all types of videogames, from a 90s kart racer, to a rejected mascot horror villain, to a dating sim featuring Roger's very own ex wife! Each fight incorporates gameplay twists from their respective genres, so you'll never know how the next one will play out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to <strong>BOSS UP</strong>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>18 Brutal Boss Fights</strong> on your quest to become the ultimate Boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>Over 20 Unique Weapons</strong> to bring the heat to these Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between<strong> Several</strong> <strong>Silly Hats</strong> to gain perks in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab a Drink</strong> with your foes between fights and learn all the hot gossip</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn<strong> P Ranks</strong> by defeating Bosses without taking any damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832570/extras/1f6cf2ddbe78fa1d42377981c77bbda4.poster.avif?t=1756072989\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832570/extras/1f6cf2ddbe78fa1d42377981c77bbda4.webm?t=1756072989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832570/extras/1f6cf2ddbe78fa1d42377981c77bbda4.mp4?t=1756072989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to<strong> BOSS UP</strong> in this white-knuckle <strong>Bullet Hell Boss Rush</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Roger, a dodge-rolling horse with a dream! His life goal is to win the VZN tournament and gain his very own Boss Form, becoming a big time Videogame Boss! His journey won't be easy, so get ready for a brutal, keyboard-smashing challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These aren't just your run of the mill run and gun bosses, no no! These bosses come from all types of videogames, from a 90s kart racer, to a rejected mascot horror villain, to a dating sim featuring Roger's very own ex wife! Each fight incorporates gameplay twists from their respective genres, so you'll never know how the next one will play out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to <strong>BOSS UP</strong>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>18 Brutal Boss Fights</strong> on your quest to become the ultimate Boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>Over 20 Unique Weapons</strong> to bring the heat to these Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between<strong> Several</strong> <strong>Silly Hats</strong> to gain perks in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab a Drink</strong> with your foes between fights and learn all the hot gossip</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn<strong> P Ranks</strong> by defeating Bosses without taking any damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Boss Up is a love letter to videogame bosses, from infuriating RPG final bosses, to kart racing rivals, and even dating sim ex-wives. Fight your way through 18 bullet hell bosses with your powerful dodge roll, and try not to break your keyboard in half in this tough as nails action platformer!",
